    "CoiStatement": "This study was based on an under-graduate thesis in ShahidBeheshti University of Medical Sciences School of Dentistry, Tehran, Iran, and partially supported by grant 5217 from office of research affairs of the mentioned faculty. 3M ESPE and Bisco representatives in Iran are greatly appreciated for providing the materials needed.",
    "Article": {
